:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemies, see [[Hikakin (Enemy)]] and [[Mukyakin (Enemy)]].''
'''Hikakin''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 2.6 Update|Version 2.6]] and was a [[Hikakin Collaboration Event|collaboration]] with the YouTuber of the same name. To unlock said unit was to input the code (ヒカ－キン ) and after reaching level 10, his [[True Form]] was obtained by using the code ( ひかきん － しんか ). As of [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]], this long-standing collaboration unit became unobtainable due to the removed feature of inputting [[Serial Codes]]. In a newer collab in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]], it and its True Form was made obtainable as drop rewards. True Form has no statistical changes and is purely aesthetic.

{{Cat Info
