==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Bikyakin''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Mukyakin''' by when obtained from the [[Hikakin Awakens!]]<sup>8.0 onward</sup> or when the code ( ひかきん － しんか ) is used<sup>before 8.0</sup> and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hikakin can serve as a temporary version of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] until said Cat is obtained, similarly to [[Vengeful Cat (Rare Cat)|Vengeful Cat]] or [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]]. Much like them, he quickly becomes useless afterwards due to lower overall stats. He may still find use in providing some [[User Rank]], though.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Midranger}}

