==Trivia==
*This cat is based on [http://www.youtube.com/user/HikakinGames HikakinGames] - a famous Japanese Youtuber.
*Bikyakin's name is a portmanteau of 美 ''bi'' (beautiful) and ''Hikakin''.
*Mukyakin's name is a portmanteau of むきむき ''mukimuki'' (an informal term for "muscular") and ''Hikakin''.
*Mukyakin is the only [[True Form]] not to change a unit's [[Battle|battle]] performance in any way.
*Its first collaboration event was the longest a collab has ever been held as it lasted from its addition until inputting serial codes were removed.

